;; M4N slice 1 refusal: the negated relation is DERIVED (written by a cone
;; stratum), so its transitions are not an input journal the route can
;; finalize upfront -- slice 2/3 territory; today it falls back to rerun.

table (a int)
table (b int)
table (m int)
table (g int)

rule
(a X)
-->
(m X)

rule
(b X)
~(m X)
-->
(g X)
